From b8ea4e603288e7ab1b4fc9b088487c9720730a6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:40:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Incursions: assault, headquarters and mothership sites; wiki
 ship stats

Sites for every system type.  TopUpSites() now takes the scene type and keeps
vanguard, assault and headquarters systems at SitesPerSystem live sites of their
own kind.  incSiteTypes.sceneType is INT so the mothership can use
Incursion::scenesType::boss (1000001); new columns secBand (0 any, 1 high-sec
only, 2 low/null only) and objectiveTypeID.

Objectives.  When a site has an objectiveTypeID, that NPC is never scaled down by
FleetScale and the site completes as soon as it dies (remaining ships go with
the site).  Boss sites spawn the next wave (cycling 2..N) every 60-300 s while
the objective lives, capped at designNPCs live ships.

Mothership.  Zero influence no longer withdraws by itself.  Completing a
headquarters site at zero influence calls BreakInfluence(): Withdrawing, a
broadcast, and the HQ system's cooldown is cleared so the boss site matching the
system's security band spawns at once.  Killing the objective sets endPending,
which ends the incursion on the next tick; otherwise WithdrawTime ends it.  New
GM option /incursion mothership.

Payouts in systems below 0.45 true security are 10/7 of the high-sec values
(EVE University wiki).  FleetSize (pilots) is replaced by FleetScale (percent of
each site's design fleet, default 100).  MobilizeAfter defaults to 120 h and
WithdrawTime to 1440 min.  Strength now scales missileDamageMultiplier and NPC
remote shield boost amount instead of missile launch time.

NPCAIMgr::LaunchMissile() applies the launcher's missileDamageMultiplier to the
charge for incursion Sansha groups only (1051-1056).  Other NPCs have values in
the db but their missile damage was balanced without it.

Migration rewritten: stats for 33 types from the EVE University wiki enemy tables
(signature, speed, orbit, DPS, volley, range, raw HP and EHP; raw HP split
60/25/15 with an omni shield/armor resonance that reproduces the wiki EHP), no
self shield boost, torpedoes via Juggernaut/Bane with damage multiplier, launch
time and velocity/flight-time multipliers from volley, DPS and range; wiki EWAR
values in the entity EWAR attributes (only warp scramble is used by NPCAI).
Stand-ins: type 3492 'Sansha' for Sansha's Nation Commander, 3495 and 3491 for
the TCRC battletower and TPPH mobile headquarters.  Nine sites from the wiki
plus the Kundalini Manifest (high-sec) and Uroborus (low/null-sec); wave counts
are fixed picks from the wiki rosters and distances.
